2574 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Tighten the rocker arm fastening screws and try extruding again\056 Tap the settings icon on the right side of the toolbar\054 then select\240\034Control\035 \055 \034Extruder\035\056 Set the temperature to approximately 250\260C and the length to 50mm\054 then tap the down arrow to extrude\056 Observe whether the extruder gear is turning\056 If it turns properly\054 proceed to the next steps\056 If it does not turn\054 check whether the motor is operating\056 If the motor is not running\054 contact customer support for assistance\056)
